  "prefLabel": "Stra 1104.05 Scholarship Award",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-07-02",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Stra 1104.05 Scholarship Award. Scholarships shall be awarded in a lump sum to the eligible student for the entire length of the eligible program consistent with Stra 1106, to be held by the office to be disbursed by the awarding participating postsecondary institution on an annual, semester, trimester, or quarterly basis on a date set by the awarding institution. An eligible student shall receive a governor’s scholarship award after they have earned 100% of Title IV aid in order to earn 100% of governor’s scholarship program funds for each term. Eligible students shall only be awarded a single scholarship by the governor’s scholarship program.\n\nSource. #12446, INTERIM, eff 1-3-18, EXPIRES: 7-2-18; ss by #12550, eff 6-19-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/stra1100.html"
